# Allow-list: the image needs the lockfile, the package source and the files
# its metadata names. Everything else -- `.venv`, a `.foldjax/` weight store,
# prediction outputs, benchmarks -- would bloat the context or leak into it.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
